    pk:hasVerdict "faithful" .

<https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/morphoeval-delphi10000-eldredgeops-rana-18file-turing-wavelength-s0-model-fidelity> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Turing k_c at 492 nm for the 18-file Eldredgeops eye (Cazenovian, 387 Ma) — Model fidelity to source: 88/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-27"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "The script implements Schnakenberg kinetics, the steady-state Jacobian, the four Turing inequalities, and k_c^2 = (Dv f_u + Du g_v) / (2 Du Dv), then rescales space so lambda_c equals the assigned 492 nm. The 2D step is a Fourier reaction-diffusion split of those same terms. It is not a fit to a measured Devonian diffusivity." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-model-fidelity> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/model/grok-4.7> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/model-fidelity" ;
    pk:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-eldredgeops-rana-18file-turing-wavelength-s0-model-fidelity-1>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-eldredgeops-rana-18file-turing-wavelength-s0-model-fidelity-2> ;
    pk:hasScore 8.8e-01 ;
    pk:hasVerdict "faithful" .

<https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/morphoeval-delphi10000-eldredgeops-rana-18file-turing-wavelength-s0-morphometric-validation> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Turing k_c at 492 nm for the 18-file Eldredgeops eye (Cazenovian, 387 Ma) — Morphometric validation: 78/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-27"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Dispersion Pearson r = 1.0 with RMSE 3.15e-12 on real-eigenvalue modes (spectral mode plus RK4). Nonlinear FFT wavelength is 574 nm against the linear reference 492 nm. Specimen structure-tensor coherency is 0.479 against 0.746 on the simulated field. KS, Otsu foreground, and multi-seed CV are not in the Pass-1 measurement set." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-morphometric-validation> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/model/grok-4.7> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/morphometric-validation" ;
    pk:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-eldredgeops-rana-18file-turing-wavelength-s0-measurement-conserved-arc-wavelengths-per-file-ratio-versus-17-file-successor>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-eldredgeops-rana-18file-turing-wavelength-s0-measurement-equal-diffusion-ablation-max-real-growth-rate>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-eldredgeops-rana-18file-turing-wavelength-s0-measurement-nonlinear-fft-wavelength-of-the-saturated-u-field>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-eldredgeops-rana-18file-turing-wavelength-s0-measurement-rk4-vs-eigenvalue-dispersion-pearson-r>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-eldredgeops-rana-18file-turing-wavelength-s0-measurement-specimen-eye-structure-tensor-coherency>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-eldredgeops-rana-18file-turing-wavelength-s0-morphometric-validation-1>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-eldredgeops-rana-18file-turing-wavelength-s0-morphometric-validation-2> ;
    pk:hasScore 7.8e-01 ;
    pk:hasVerdict "mostly faithful" .

<https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/morphoeval-delphi10000-eldredgeops-rana-18file-turing-wavelength-s0-overall> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Turing k_c at 492 nm for the 18-file Eldredgeops eye (Cazenovian, 387 Ma) — MorphoEval overall 80.7/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-27"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Pass 1 integrates the Schnakenberg system so the linear critical wavelength is exactly 492 nm (4.915e-07 m) at 387 Ma. RK4 growth rates on the Turing band match the leading eigenvalue (Pearson r = 1, RMSE ~ 3e-12) because the spatial operator is spectral and the initial condition is the eigenvector. The saturated 2D field selects a nonlinear FFT peak at 574 nm. Equal diffusivities give max Re(sigma) = -0.812. The 12-frame 720x540 GIF ends on the CC BY-SA Commons eye photograph. The 18-to-17 file step changes wavelengths per file by 18/17 if the dorsoventral arc is conserved; it does not retune k_c. Gamma sweep, ablation field, Otsu mask, and KS test are implemented but not executed in this pass. Overall 80.7/100 (faithfulness 78.1, reproducibility 86.8); rubric morphoeval 0.1.0; checkpoint commit 332efe5138233530509bf80322afc73c77f98255; environment: . Dimension assessments: Model fidelity to source 88, Morphological realism / specimen match 76, Parameter expressivity 64, Morphometric validation 78, Source and data traceability 90, Code-to-model traceability 84, Reproducibility package 86. Output judged: docs/media/eldredgeops_rana_18file_turing_wavelength_s0_comparison.png: rendered output of models/2026-delphi10000-eldredgeops-rana-18file-turing-wavelength-s0.py at 332efe5138233530509bf80322afc73c77f98255, image/png, 406017 B, 1344×1008 px, artifact_sha256 12bd2e9acf0b5629c68bef5675d5aa9e03d27a738ad78a3a833b858afe4275b6 (sha256 12bd2e9acf0b5629c68bef5675d5aa9e03d27a738ad78a3a833b858afe4275b6), spec_fingerprint 77967ca675ff28a543407cf6030276194492fe8aeb2e1d000397c86f88e1f90a. Dual provenance: spec_fingerprint: 77967ca675ff28a543407cf6030276194492fe8aeb2e1d000397c86f88e1f90a; artifact_sha256: 12bd2e9acf0b5629c68bef5675d5aa9e03d27a738ad78a3a833b858afe4275b6; input_dataset_sha256: {datasets/eldredgeops_rana_18file_turing_wavelength_s0/eldredgeops_rana_18file_turing_wavelength_s0_reference.json=8ef91c6ae2a52449..., datasets/eldredgeops_rana_18file_turing_wavelength_s0/eldredgeops_rana_18file_turing_wavelength_s0_specimen.jpg=3a83d6e639450366...}. Claim boundary: reported_in_source: Turing 1952 states the diffusion-driven instability and a critical wavenumber. | Schnakenberg 1979 states the two-species reaction used here. | Eldredge 1972 documents Phacops (Eldredgeops) rana lens-file counts through the Middle Devonian. | Clarkson, Levi-Setti and Horváth 2006 describe schizochroal eyes as calcite lens arrays.; reconstructed_in_script: Slot parameters a=0.146, b=1.038, gamma=2.40, Du_pre=0.018, Dv_pre=0.492 rescaled so lambda_c = 492 nm. | RK4 modal growth versus the 2x2 dispersion eigenvalue. | Fourier-split 2D nonlinear field on a 96^2 grid spanning six linear wavelengths. | Conserved-arc ratio 18/17 between this 387 Ma morph and the 384 Ma 17-file successor.; transfer_boundary: 492 nm is the campaign detail-scale assignment (tier 2_macromolecular_100nm), not a length Eldredge published. | The Commons photograph is an Eldredgeops rana eye, not a proven Cazenovian 18-file voucher.; does_not_claim: That Devonian lens pigment used these Schnakenberg coefficients. | That the photograph is a solution of the PDE. | That losing one lens file changes k_c. | That the unsigned nanopublications were published by the template ORCID holder.." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/concept/morphoeval-rubric-0.1.0> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/model/grok-4.7> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/overall" ;
    pk:evidenceAgainst "remediation needed: Nanopublications cannot be signed: ~/.nanopub/profile.yml is absent.",
        "remediation needed: Negative control: equal-diffusion max sigma is analytic only; the ablation field is not simulated in the Pass-1 render.",
        "remediation needed: No independent second assessor scored this pass.",
        "remediation needed: Parameter-regime sweep: gamma and Dv/Du sweeps are defined but not executed or drawn on the Pass-1 figure.",
        "remediation needed: Specimen segmentation: whole-frame coherency is reported, but Otsu foreground, radial-spectrum KS, and multi-seed wavelength are not in the Pass-1 outputs." ;
    pk:hasScore 8.07e-01 ;
    pk:hasVerdict "faithful" .

<https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/morphoeval-delphi10000-eldredgeops-rana-18file-turing-wavelength-s0-parameter-expressivity> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
